WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.646 --> 00:00:02.497
It's 11:48 at night.

2
00:00:02.497 --> 00:00:04.312
Your phone hasn't stopped buzzing:

3
00:00:04.312 --> 00:00:06.006
three apps, one owner,

4
00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:07.378
and nobody to answer.

5
00:00:08.158 --> 00:00:08.975
How much?

6
00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:09.876
Are you open?

7
00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:10.958
Is it in stock?

8
00:00:10.958 --> 00:00:12.557
Every slow reply is a customer

9
00:00:12.557 --> 00:00:13.927
who asked someone else,

10
00:00:13.927 --> 00:00:15.347
and they rarely come back.

11
00:00:16.546 --> 00:00:17.483
Meet Yapoz:

12
00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:19.575
the front desk that never closes.

13
00:00:19.575 --> 00:00:21.450
One assistant for every chat,

14
00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.627
trained on your business,

15
00:00:22.627 --> 00:00:24.083
and only your business.

16
00:00:25.346 --> 00:00:26.403
Teach it once.

17
00:00:26.403 --> 00:00:28.266
Type it, or snap your menu.

18
00:00:28.266 --> 00:00:30.069
Yapoz drafts your prices,

19
00:00:30.069 --> 00:00:31.211
hours and rules,

20
00:00:31.211 --> 00:00:32.426
and you check each one.

21
00:00:33.146 --> 00:00:34.648
Then it answers on WhatsApp,

22
00:00:34.648 --> 00:00:36.367
Telegram and Instagram,

23
00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:37.413
in seconds.

24
00:00:37.413 --> 00:00:38.566
It checks your prices,

25
00:00:38.566 --> 00:00:39.696
stock and free slots

26
00:00:39.696 --> 00:00:40.862
before it speaks,

27
00:00:40.862 --> 00:00:42.258
and never makes things up.

28
00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:45.446
Bookings go into real free slots.

29
00:00:45.446 --> 00:00:46.984
Orders wait for your yes,

30
00:00:46.984 --> 00:00:48.102
and the customer knows

31
00:00:48.102 --> 00:00:49.413
the moment you tap.

32
00:00:50.146 --> 00:00:51.468
Anything it isn't sure of

33
00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:52.429
comes to you,

34
00:00:52.429 --> 00:00:54.725
with a holding reply already sent.

35
00:00:54.725 --> 00:00:55.952
Nothing is invented.

36
00:00:57.158 --> 00:00:58.083
Yapoz.

37
00:00:58.083 --> 00:00:58.973
Every question,

38
00:00:58.973 --> 00:00:59.731
answered.
